l-adapter-interface-deferring-enterprise-sso-purchase-until-an-enterprise-deal-requires-it)392 0 R(dead-end-recommend-auth0-as-the-default-vendor)394 0 R(dead-end-recommend-pure-buy-option-b-with-no-internal-adapter-layer-as-the-single-answer)395 0 R(dead-end-use-ssojetcoms-vendor-blog-statistics-68-hard-gate-rate-340k780k-revenue-impact-28180-sso-pricing-premium-as-quantitative-ground-truths)397 0 R(dead-end-use-the-ibm-cost-of-a-data-breach-averages-as-a-literal-dollar-estimate-of-this-companys-breach-exposure)396 0 R(executive-summary)381 0 R]>>>>>>
